    "startSeconds": 244.97,
    "endSeconds": 245.67,
    "text": "In Asia."
  },
  {
    "index": 90,
    "sceneId": "s8_south_korea_s_hyundai_card_launc",
    "startFrame": 7394,
    "endFrame": 7486,
    "startSeconds": 246.45,
    "endSeconds": 249.53,
    "text": "Hyundai Card has launched AI tools for its partners,"
  },
  {
    "index": 91,
    "sceneId": "s8_south_korea_s_hyundai_card_launc",
    "startFrame": 7497,
    "endFrame": 7527,
    "startSeconds": 249.89,
    "endSeconds": 250.89,
    "text": "Tech in Asia reports."
  },
  {
    "index": 92,
    "sceneId": "s8_south_korea_s_hyundai_card_launc",
    "startFrame": 7566,
    "endFrame": 7706,
    "startSeconds": 252.19,
    "endSeconds": 256.85,
    "text": "The company said PLCC 2.0 draws on roughly US800 million"
  },
  {
    "index": 93,
    "sceneId": "s8_south_korea_s_hyundai_card_launc",
    "startFrame": 7706,
    "endFrame": 7798,
    "startSeconds": 256.85,
    "endSeconds": 259.95,
    "text": "dollars invested in AI and data science over the last"
  },
  {
    "index": 94,
    "sceneId": "s8_south_korea_s_hyundai_card_launc",
    "startFrame": 7798,
    "endFrame": 7812,
    "startSeconds": 259.95,
    "endSeconds": 260.39,
    "text": "decade."
  },
  {
    "index": 95,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 7879,
    "endFrame": 7943,
    "startSeconds": 262.63,
    "endSeconds": 264.77,
    "text": "And now, our research story of the week."
  },
  {
    "index": 96,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 7974,
    "endFrame": 8059,
    "startSeconds": 265.81,
    "endSeconds": 268.63,
    "text": "Researchers have introduced a speech recognition system"
  },
  {
    "index": 97,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 8059,
    "endFrame": 8141,
    "startSeconds": 268.63,
    "endSeconds": 271.37,
    "text": "built so it never goes back and changes words it has"
  },
  {
    "index": 98,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 8141,
    "endFrame": 8162,
    "startSeconds": 271.37,
    "endSeconds": 272.07,
    "text": "already produced."
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 8198,
    "endFrame": 8288,
    "startSeconds": 273.25,
    "endSeconds": 276.25,
    "text": "Their paper is titled Confucius4-R2T2:"
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 8299,
    "endFrame": 8396,
    "startSeconds": 276.63,
    "endSeconds": 279.87,
    "text": "A Stable-Prefix Streaming ASR Model for Real Real-Time"
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 8396,
    "endFrame": 8411,
    "startSeconds": 279.87,
    "endSeconds": 280.37,
    "text": "Transcription."
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 8447,
    "endFrame": 8521,
    "startSeconds": 281.57,
    "endSeconds": 284.03,
    "text": "ASR stands for automatic speech recognition,"
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 8543,
    "endFrame": 8622,
    "startSeconds": 284.77,
    "endSeconds": 287.39,
    "text": "and streaming means the transcript is generated while"
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 8622,
    "endFrame": 8655,
    "startSeconds": 287.39,
    "endSeconds": 288.49,
    "text": "someone is still talking."
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 8686,
    "endFrame": 8786,
    "startSeconds": 289.55,
    "endSeconds": 292.85,
    "text": "Live captions, translation software and voice assistants"
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 8786,
    "endFrame": 8872,
    "startSeconds": 292.85,
    "endSeconds": 295.73,
    "text": "increasingly act on each word the moment it appears."
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 8908,
    "endFrame": 8984,
    "startSeconds": 296.95,
    "endSeconds": 299.45,
    "text": "When a recognizer later revises an early word,"
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 8994,
    "endFrame": 9044,
    "startSeconds": 299.81,
    "endSeconds": 301.45,
    "text": "a problem sometimes called flicker,"
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 9055,
    "endFrame": 9093,
    "startSeconds": 301.83,
    "endSeconds": 303.09,
    "text": "any work built on it is wasted,"
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 9111,
    "endFrame": 9189,
    "startSeconds": 303.69,
    "endSeconds": 306.29,
    "text": "and an AI agent might even take the wrong action."
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 9222,
    "endFrame": 9284,
    "startSeconds": 307.39,
    "endSeconds": 309.45,
    "text": "The researchers argue that this kind of stability"
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 9284,
    "endFrame": 9359,
    "startSeconds": 309.45,
    "endSeconds": 311.97,
    "text": "matters just as much as accuracy and speed."
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 9383,
    "endFrame": 9456,
    "startSeconds": 312.77,
    "endSeconds": 315.21,
    "text": "To tackle it, they took an existing model,"
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 9471,
    "endFrame": 9628,
    "startSeconds": 315.71,
    "endSeconds": 320.93,
    "text": "Qwen3-ASR-1.7B, and gave it further training on 1,500"
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 9628,
    "endFrame": 9679,
    "startSeconds": 320.93,
    "endSeconds": 322.63,
    "text": "hours of Chinese and English audio,"
  },
  {
    "index": 116,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 9693,
    "endFrame": 9770,
    "startSeconds": 323.09,
    "endSeconds": 325.67,
    "text": "leaving its core audio-processing components frozen."
  },
  {
    "index": 117,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 9805,
    "endFrame": 9889,
    "startSeconds": 326.83,
    "endSeconds": 329.63,
    "text": "The method rests on an idea they call the Longest Stable"
  },
  {
    "index": 118,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 9889,
    "endFrame": 9983,
    "startSeconds": 329.63,
    "endSeconds": 332.77,
    "text": "Prefix, essentially the opening stretch of a transcript"
  },
  {
    "index": 119,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 9983,
    "endFrame": 10062,
    "startSeconds": 332.77,
    "endSeconds": 335.39,
    "text": "that can safely be committed without later correction."
  },
  {
    "index": 120,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 10095,
    "endFrame": 10172,
    "startSeconds": 336.49,
    "endSeconds": 339.05,
    "text": "They provide mathematical proof that this measure"
  },
  {
    "index": 121,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 10172,
    "endFrame": 10251,
    "startSeconds": 339.05,
    "endSeconds": 341.69,
    "text": "behaves consistently and matches what the model would"
  },
  {
    "index": 122,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 10251,
    "endFrame": 10311,
    "startSeconds": 341.69,
    "endSeconds": 343.69,
    "text": "output after hearing the complete recording."
  },
  {
    "index": 123,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 10336,
    "endFrame": 10421,
    "startSeconds": 344.55,
    "endSeconds": 347.37,
    "text": "Training on these labels turns a model designed for"
  },
  {
    "index": 124,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 10421,
    "endFrame": 10503,
    "startSeconds": 347.37,
    "endSeconds": 350.11,
    "text": "finished recordings into a stable live transcriber,"
  },
  {
    "index": 125,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 10503,
    "endFrame": 10576,
    "startSeconds": 350.11,
    "endSeconds": 352.55,
    "text": "with no change to its underlying design."
  },
  {
    "index": 126,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 10606,
    "endFrame": 10684,
    "startSeconds": 353.53,
    "endSeconds": 356.15,
    "text": "In testing, the system came close to the original"
  },
  {
    "index": 127,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 10684,
    "endFrame": 10764,
    "startSeconds": 356.15,
    "endSeconds": 358.81,
    "text": "model's quality on full recordings while producing"
  },
  {
    "index": 128,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 10764,
    "endFrame": 10817,
    "startSeconds": 358.81,
    "endSeconds": 360.57,
    "text": "steady text with little delay."
  },
  {
    "index": 129,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 10842,
    "endFrame": 10931,
    "startSeconds": 361.41,
    "endSeconds": 364.37,
    "text": "The improvements also carried over to languages beyond"
  },
  {
    "index": 130,
    "sceneId": "s9_confucius4_r2t2_a_stable_prefix",
    "startFrame": 10931,
    "endFrame": 10966,
    "startSeconds": 364.37,
    "endSeconds": 365.55,
    "text": "the two used in training."
  },
